<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial; }
  p, td, span { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans"; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo_1" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px; margin-right: 10px;">
    <div style="display: inline-block;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">Center for Safety Equity in Transportation</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 2px 0 0 0;">If you have a right to get there, you have a right to get there safely.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 8pt; margin: 2px 0 0 0;">University of Alaska Fairbanks | 245 Duckering | 907-474-5552 | cset.utc@alaska.edu</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">Program Progress Performance Report for University Transportation Centers</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Submitted to:</p>
      <p><span data-field="submitted_to_name">{{ submitted_to_name }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="submitted_to_address_line_1">{{ submitted_to_address_line_1 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="submitted_to_address_line_2">{{ submitted_to_address_line_2 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="submitted_to_address_line_3">{{ submitted_to_address_line_3 }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Project Title:</p>
      <p><span data-field="project_title">{{ project_title }}</span></p>
      <p>Program Director:</p>
      <p><span data-field="program_director_name">{{ program_director_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Email:</p>
      <p><span data-field="program_director_email">{{ program_director_email }}</span></p>
      <p>Phone:</p>
      <p><span data-field="program_director_phone">{{ program_director_phone }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Submission Date:</p>
      <p><span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span></p>
      <p>DUNS Number:</p>
      <p><span data-field="duns_number">{{ duns_number }}</span></p>
      <p>EIN Number:</p>
      <p><span data-field="ein_number">{{ ein_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Recipient Organization:</p>
      <p><span data-field="recipient_organization_name">{{ recipient_organization_name }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="recipient_organization_address_line_1">{{ recipient_organization_address_line_1 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="recipient_organization_address_line_2">{{ recipient_organization_address_line_2 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="recipient_organization_address_line_3">{{ recipient_organization_address_line_3 }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Project Grant Period:</p>
      <p><span data-field="project_grant_period">{{ project_grant_period }}</span></p>
      <p>Reporting Period End Date:</p>
      <p><span data-field="reporting_period_end_date">{{ reporting_period_end_date }}</span></p>
      <p>Report Term:</p>
      <p><span data-field="report_term">{{ report_term }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Signature:</p>
      <div style="height: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 5px;"></div>
      <p><span data-field="signer_name">{{ signer_name }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="signer_title">{{ signer_title }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">Abbreviations</h2>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li>AKDOT&amp;PF – <span data-field="abbreviation_akdotpf">{{ abbreviation_akdotpf }}</span></li>
    <li>ANTHC – <span data-field="abbreviation_anthc">{{ abbreviation_anthc }}</span></li>
    <li>AUTC – <span data-field="abbreviation_autc">{{ abbreviation_autc }}</span></li>
    <li>CSET – <span data-field="abbreviation_cset">{{ abbreviation_cset }}</span></li>
    <li>PPPR – <span data-field="abbreviation_pppr">{{ abbreviation_pppr }}</span></li>
    <li>RIP – <span data-field="abbreviation_rip">{{ abbreviation_rip }}</span></li>
    <li>RITI – <span data-field="abbreviation_riti">{{ abbreviation_riti }}</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="margin-bottom: 20px;">1. Accomplishments</h2>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">What are the major goals and objectives of the program?</h3>
  <p><span data-field="goals_objectives_description">{{ goals_objectives_description }}</span></p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">What was accomplished under these goals?</h3>
  <p>During the past six months of the project:</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li><span data-field="accomplishment_advisory_board">{{ accomplishment_advisory_board }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="accomplishment_setting_up_email">{{ accomplishment_setting_up_email }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="accomplishment_research_projects">{{ accomplishment_research_projects }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Research projects</h3>
  <p><span data-field="research_projects_summary">{{ research_projects_summary }}</span></p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo_2" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px;">
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 8pt;">UNIVERSITY OF ALASKA</p>
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 8pt;">MANOAA</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo_3" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px;">
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 8pt;">UNIVERSITY OF IDAHO</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo_4" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px;">
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 8pt;">UNIVERSITY OF WASHINGTON</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">2</p>
  <p>No projects officially began in this reporting period, but proposals were accepted for the year. Projects under three primary areas: knowledge gathering, outreach, and baseline data collection. It is expected the Center's first projects will begin in the next period. The project information will be posted on the CSET website, and will be logged in the RIP database. Annual project update meetings will be held each summer, and quarterly reports will be collected in a timely manner.</p>

  <p><span data-field="cset_director_statement">{{ cset_director_statement }}</span></p>

  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li><span data-field="training_programs_status">{{ training_programs_status }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="active_student_internships_status">{{ active_student_internships_status }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="teacher_training_status">{{ teacher_training_status }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="data_collection_tools_status">{{ data_collection_tools_status }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="outreach_technology_transfer_status">{{ outreach_technology_transfer_status }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">What opportunities for training and professional development has the program provided?</h3>
  <p><span data-field="training_opportunities_provided">{{ training_opportunities_provided }}</span></p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">How have the results been disseminated?</h3>
  <p><span data-field="results_dissemination_summary">{{ results_dissemination_summary }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">3</p>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Research</h2>
  <p><span data-field="research_summary">{{ research_summary }}</span></p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Professional Meetings</h3>
  <p>During this reporting period, CSET representatives attended the following professional events:</p>
  <ol style="padding-left: 40px;">
    <li><span data-field="meeting_1_name">{{ meeting_1_name }}</span>, <span data-field="meeting_1_date">{{ meeting_1_date }}</span>.</li>
    <li><span data-field="meeting_2_name">{{ meeting_2_name }}</span>, <span data-field="meeting_2_date">{{ meeting_2_date }}</span>.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Outreach</h3>
  <p>International Week of the Arctic, <span data-field="outreach_date">{{ outreach_date }}</span>. Center Director <span data-field="director_name">{{ director_name }}</span> presented as part of a panel called "<span data-field="panel_title">{{ panel_title }}</span>".</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">What do you plan to do during the next reporting period to accomplish the goals and objectives?</h3>
  <p>We will follow the implementation plan to ensure that all the CSET's funded research, education, and outreach activities move forward as scheduled.</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li><span data-field="plan_first_round">{{ plan_first_round }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="plan_center_website">{{ plan_center_website }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="plan_quarterly_newsletter">{{ plan_quarterly_newsletter }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="plan_steps_to_begin">{{ plan_steps_to_begin }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="plan_center_researchers">{{ plan_center_researchers }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">2. Products</h3>
  <p>Publications, conference papers, presentations, websites, lectures, seminars, workshops, invited talks</p>
